nsform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】南紀勝浦温泉　ホテル浦島 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">3. 南紀勝浦温泉 くつろぎの宿 料理旅館 万清楼（勝浦港すぐ）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.43</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/68247/68247.jpg\" alt=\"南紀勝浦温泉　くつろぎの宿　料理旅館　万清楼 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜勝浦港の目の前！生まぐろと熊野牛の本格懐石を味わう落ち着いた和風割烹旅館〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">美食家、シニア、ご夫婦、落ち着いた大人の旅。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 当施設</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「勝浦港の絶品生マグロ料理とおもてなしを静かに味わうなら迷わずここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F68247%2F68247.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】南紀勝浦温泉　くつろぎの宿　料理旅館　万清楼 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">4. ホテル川久（白浜・周遊用）</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.54</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/14111/14111.jpg\" alt=\"白浜温泉　ホテル川久 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">大切な人と過ごす記念日や誕生日旅行、心と体をじっくり解きほぐす週末のご褒美旅、和歌山県の味覚とお湯を愛でる大人の休日。</p>\n  <h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">② この宿を選ぶべき人</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">和歌山県の名所巡りを楽しみながら、お宿でも妥協なく上質なお料理とおもてなしを満喫したい旅行者。</p>\n  <h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">③ この宿で得られる体験</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">窓の外に広がる和歌山県の四季の借景と、湯量豊富な温泉での湯浴み。滋味豊かな